  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>&nbsp;be an arithmetic progression with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;and common difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>&nbsp;be such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;fo <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Then, which of the following is/are TRUE?",
    "image": null
